WEBVTT

00:01.060 --> 00:02.730
To my Mother who I have yet to meet:

00:03.230 --> 00:05.560
In Spain , I learned things like the flamenco...

00:05.940 --> 00:08.570
and learned of the adult love between Jose and Carmen...

00:09.530 --> 00:13.200
I wonder if you've ever experienced love like that before, Mother?

00:14.160 --> 00:16.450
Right now, I'm heading towards Greece.

00:26.420 --> 00:27.710
NAAJA

00:26.420 --> 00:27.710
Nadja,

00:27.840 --> 00:30.380
With your eyes

00:27.840 --> 00:30.380
Kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:30.380 --> 00:31.590
Nadja,

00:30.380 --> 00:31.590
NAAJA

00:31.630 --> 00:33.880
What do you see?

00:31.630 --> 00:33.880
Nani ga mieru

00:33.930 --> 00:36.800
Shining in the far distance,

00:33.930 --> 00:36.800
Haruka tooku hikaru

00:36.800 --> 00:39.180
The door to the future,

00:36.800 --> 00:39.180
Mirai no tobira

00:40.100 --> 00:43.560
That's what I'm searching for

00:40.100 --> 00:43.560
Sagashite iru

00:43.560 --> 00:50.780
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:51.480 --> 00:54.990
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:51.480 --> 00:54.990
Minna egao de aetara

00:55.070 --> 00:58.320
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

00:55.070 --> 00:58.320
Arasoi mo kitto nakunaru

00:58.370 --> 01:01.580
It could be so much more fun

00:58.370 --> 01:01.580
Konna ni mo tanoshi kunaru

01:01.620 --> 01:05.040
The world is wide, but it's still one

01:01.620 --> 01:05.040
Sekai wa hiroi kedo hitotsu ne

01:05.420 --> 01:08.710
I can't see the end of the journey

01:05.420 --> 01:08.710
Tabi no owari wa mienai

01:08.840 --> 01:12.170
God is the only one who could possibly know

01:08.840 --> 01:12.170
Kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:12.340 --> 01:15.930
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:12.340 --> 01:15.930
Itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:15.970 --> 01:18.090
I will go waving

01:15.970 --> 01:18.090
Te wo furinagara

01:18.180 --> 01:24.850
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:18.180 --> 01:24.850
Toki ni wa BURUU ni naru hi mo aru kedo

01:24.890 --> 01:27.600
But I won't look back

01:24.890 --> 01:27.600
Ushiro mukanai

01:27.940 --> 01:32.900
Until the day my dream comes true

01:27.940 --> 01:32.900
Yume ga kanau hi made

01:33.190 --> 01:36.610
Nadja, Your smile

01:33.190 --> 01:36.610
NAAJA kimi no hohoemi wa

01:36.700 --> 01:40.030
Nadja, gives me courage

01:36.700 --> 01:40.030
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:40.070 --> 01:42.990
Under the blue sky,

01:40.070 --> 01:42.990
Aoi sora no shita de

01:43.120 --> 01:45.960
I will find the place

01:43.120 --> 01:45.960
Ashita no yukue

01:46.250 --> 01:50.170
where my future lies

01:46.250 --> 01:50.170
Mitsukeru kara

02:02.280 --> 02:05.410
﻿If I hem this cloth to the end of it here...

02:09.630 --> 02:12.840
﻿and make it a bit more frilly and add a ribbon, it'll be really cute, right?

02:28.940 --> 02:31.520
﻿Nadja, what are you doing, with your umbrella put up like that?

02:31.690 --> 02:34.320
﻿Especially when rain hardly ever falls on the island of Mikonos...

02:34.820 --> 02:36.030
﻿It doesn't have to do with the rain.

02:36.690 --> 02:39.820
﻿I've been thinking I could maybe make up a dance using this umbrella.

02:39.990 --> 02:40.740
﻿A dance?

02:40.860 --> 02:42.200
﻿Yeah. If I use this...

02:42.780 --> 02:46.040
﻿I can open it... or close it.., or twirl it around like this

02:46.540 --> 02:47.750
﻿It's because it seems as if I do so much with it!

02:47.950 --> 02:50.210
Oh? So you think about that sort of stuff, Nadja?

02:50.620 --> 02:51.710
﻿Well of course I do!

02:52.130 --> 02:57.000
﻿After all, I am the miraculous dancing princess of the Dandelion Troupe!

03:05.120 --> 03:10.120
The Muddy White Rose

03:22.740 --> 03:24.320
﻿Ah, a fish jumped up!

03:24.320 --> 03:25.570
﻿Hey, that's dangerous Nadja!

03:26.200 --> 03:27.330
﻿Ah, sorry, sorry.

03:31.790 --> 03:32.790
﻿Francis?!

03:37.000 --> 03:38.710
﻿Kennosuke, take care of this for me!

03:38.710 --> 03:39.110
Yeah...

03:40.630 --> 03:42.300
﻿Nadja, is something the matter?

03:42.380 --> 03:44.340
I'﻿m sorry, but some urgent business just came up...

03:44.850 --> 03:46.470
﻿So please go on ahead without me!

03:47.430 --> 03:48.760
﻿Hey, Nadja!

03:51.600 --> 03:53.020
﻿Urgent business, she said...?

04:06.450 --> 04:07.780
﻿But, how...

04:08.660 --> 04:10.910
﻿How am I supposed to face him?

04:12.080 --> 04:15.290
﻿I don't even know whether or not that's the real Francis...

04:28.640 --> 04:30.720
﻿It's possible that it might be the Black Rose...

04:31.270 --> 04:34.310
﻿I can't believe... that the two of them share the same face.

04:37.190 --> 04:39.320
﻿And even if it is Francis...

04:39.780 --> 04:41.730
﻿How am I supposed to face him?

04:42.570 --> 04:46.070
﻿I like how you are today even more than before.

04:47.030 --> 04:50.370
﻿That wasn't Francis... that was the Black Rose.

05:03.720 --> 05:05.130
﻿There's no point in second guessing it now!

05:06.640 --> 05:09.010
﻿Whether that person is either Francis or the Black Rose,

05:09.260 --> 05:11.100
﻿if I don't confront him, nothing will happen!

05:33.290 --> 05:36.330
﻿From what I can see of him, he looks pretty Francis-like, but...

05:51.430 --> 05:52.850
﻿...he seems kind of down.

05:53.430 --> 05:54.680
﻿I wonder if something happened?

06:02.650 --> 06:03.650
﻿Francis.

06:10.660 --> 06:13.030
﻿That woman... She's the one who was in Granada with him...!

06:24.710 --> 06:28.670
﻿I wonder who she is...? She looks awfully close to him...

06:38.730 --> 06:39.810
﻿Thank you very much.

06:48.190 --> 06:50.280
﻿W-What the heck’s up with that?

06:51.490 --> 06:54.160
﻿No master how you look at it, those two look like a couple!

06:54.870 --> 06:58.000
﻿And here I was worrying about him because he had such a gloomy face! What the heck!

06:58.410 --> 07:00.370
﻿Now I can see it was all my imagination! That Francis!

07:00.370 --> 07:02.210
﻿He was just in a lover's daze.

07:02.210 --> 07:02.830
﻿Geez!

07:09.900 --> 07:11.470
Well then...

07:11.470 --> 07:13.260
﻿Yes, see you later.

07:13.680 --> 07:14.600
﻿"Later?"

07:14.600 --> 07:16.680
﻿What does she mean by "see you later"?

07:36.790 --> 07:38.080
﻿Nadja...

07:38.290 --> 07:39.790
﻿Nadja, where are you?

07:40.870 --> 07:43.540
﻿U-Umm... uh... I...

07:44.170 --> 07:45.000
﻿It's been quite a while!

07:45.380 --> 07:48.590
﻿I never thought I'd meet you here on Mikonos.

07:48.840 --> 07:49.880
﻿I-Indeed..

07:50.010 --> 07:51.380
﻿It's just as you said, huh?

07:52.380 --> 07:54.090
﻿That the two of us would surely see each other again.

07:54.430 --> 07:55.720
﻿That's right...

07:56.050 --> 07:59.220
﻿By the way... what are you doing in a place like this, Nadja?

07:59.470 --> 08:00.470
I ﻿can't tell him...

08:00.680 --> 08:02.020
﻿that I've been watching him the whole time...

08:02.310 --> 08:03.350
﻿I just can't tell him.

08:04.560 --> 08:05.600
﻿Is something wrong?

08:05.980 --> 08:08.320
﻿Umm... who are you?

08:08.690 --> 08:11.110
﻿Huh? What's gotten into you, Nadja?

08:12.650 --> 08:14.990
﻿It's me, Francis Harcourt...

08:15.370 --> 08:17.620
﻿Really? Are you really Francis?

08:24.500 --> 08:26.000
﻿At any rate, what a coincidence...

08:26.630 --> 08:29.380
﻿Perhaps this is fate?

08:31.210 --> 08:32.920
﻿It's like a miracle!

08:32.920 --> 08:34.430
﻿A blessing from God...

08:34.430 --> 08:35.340
﻿No...

08:35.760 --> 08:37.340
﻿it's definitely fate!

08:38.050 --> 08:40.600
﻿Fate... huh?

08:41.270 --> 08:44.270
﻿Please don't use the word "fate" so simply like that!

08:44.560 --> 08:45.390
Nadja?

08:46.560 --> 08:49.570
﻿That's right... Francis doesn't show anything about that...

08:50.570 --> 08:51.690
I'm sorry...

08:52.190 --> 08:53.190
﻿What's wrong?

08:53.530 --> 08:56.410
﻿The way you're acting now and a while ago... it isn't like your usual self at all.

08:57.070 --> 09:00.660
﻿Francis... what do you mean by my "usual self?,

09:01.370 --> 09:02.870
﻿Did something happen?

09:03.370 --> 09:04.080
﻿Yes...

09:04.410 --> 09:05.160
Eh?

09:05.170 --> 09:07.500
﻿What... am I supposed to do?

09:08.460 --> 09:09.840
﻿So many things have happened...

09:10.090 --> 09:11.460
﻿And I don't know the how and why of it all...

09:11.460 --> 09:13.130
﻿Yet they're happening to me all at once!

09:13.970 --> 09:15.920
﻿I... I...

09:17.340 --> 09:19.300
﻿just don't know what to do!

09:19.300 --> 09:20.680
﻿Calm down, Nadja.

09:20.930 --> 09:23.600
﻿Why don't you slowly tell me of the situation?

09:25.810 --> 09:27.020
﻿You sure are kind...

09:28.190 --> 09:31.230
﻿Are you that kind to anyone you meet, Francis?

09:31.730 --> 09:33.230
﻿What... do you mean by that?

09:34.280 --> 09:36.450
﻿That woman... who was she?

09:40.580 --> 09:42.910
﻿The one who you went dining with before...

09:43.290 --> 09:45.330
﻿Ah, she's Mary-Anne.

09:45.620 --> 09:47.040
Just a c﻿hildhood friend of mine.

09:47.500 --> 09:49.670
﻿If you had given me notice, I would've introduced you two.

09:50.920 --> 09:53.170
﻿There's no way you could've done something like that...

09:53.420 --> 09:54.250
﻿Nadja...?

09:54.880 --> 09:57.090
﻿She was together with you in Granada as well, wasn't she?

09:58.380 --> 10:00.550
﻿Then... you were also in Granada?

10:03.680 --> 10:05.020
Do you know of this?

10:05.350 --> 10:08.310
﻿That's... my mother's keepsake, her kaleidoscope!

10:09.440 --> 10:11.110
﻿Why do you...?

10:11.360 --> 10:13.650
﻿I received it from someone who looks exactly like you.

10:14.900 --> 10:17.530
﻿Why...? Why are there two of you?

10:17.530 --> 10:19.150
﻿Who is that other person?!

10:19.530 --> 10:21.450
﻿You met... Keith?

10:21.450 --> 10:23.910
﻿Keith? Who's Keith?

10:24.040 --> 10:25.910
﻿Where did you meet him?! Where's Keith?!

10:25.910 --> 10:27.080
﻿Where's my elder brother?!

10:27.210 --> 10:27.830
﻿Ow!

10:28.830 --> 10:29.870
I'm ﻿sorry...

10:30.960 --> 10:33.960
﻿Keith... is my elder twin brother.

10:34.550 --> 10:35.590
﻿Twin...?

10:35.920 --> 10:38.010
﻿Your... older brother?

10:39.220 --> 10:42.300
﻿Ever since he graduated from his schooling, he's been missing.

10:44.970 --> 10:46.180
﻿Did something happen...?

10:49.140 --> 10:50.600
﻿What happened between you and my brother?!

10:56.480 --> 10:57.900
﻿I have something I want to ask you...

10:59.070 --> 11:03.240
﻿At that time when I was still at the Applefield Orphanage, were you...

11:03.370 --> 11:06.240
﻿the person who saved me from the pair who were after my brooch?

11:07.000 --> 11:08.040
﻿Or was it...

11:09.750 --> 11:12.960
﻿It wasn't me... it must have been Keith...

11:13.210 --> 11:14.460
﻿No way!

11:16.000 --> 11:17.420
﻿That's just too cruel!

11:17.420 --> 11:20.260
﻿I always thought you were the one who saved me...!

11:21.840 --> 11:23.970
﻿Why are you so kind to me?!

11:24.390 --> 11:27.760
﻿Why did you dance with me at that time...

11:27.930 --> 11:31.230
﻿Why did you kiss me, when you already have someone you're seeing?!

11:31.600 --> 11:34.270
﻿Why... do you two keep confusing me?!

11:34.610 --> 11:37.650
﻿Even if you say there's two of you, there's no way I can reconcile the difference!

11:37.940 --> 11:39.990
﻿Why...?! Why are there two of you?!

11:40.360 --> 11:41.530
﻿Why?!

11:42.950 --> 11:46.490
Even though... I love you so much...

11:47.700 --> 11:50.250
﻿I told your brother...

11:51.210 --> 11:56.210
﻿I like how you are today even more than before"...

11:59.420 --> 12:00.420
I ﻿see...

12:02.010 --> 12:03.430
﻿The one you love...

12:03.590 --> 12:06.890
﻿might just be Keith, and not me...

12:16.230 --> 12:17.810
﻿Francis Harcourt!

12:54.770 --> 12:55.890
﻿You two are...?

12:56.270 --> 12:58.480
﻿I’m Maur from the Pegasus Orphanage!

12:58.730 --> 13:00.440
﻿Don't tell me you've forgotten!

13:02.150 --> 13:05.450
﻿Go home! Get off this island at once!

13:06.450 --> 13:07.660
﻿You know, don't you?

13:08.200 --> 13:09.700
Becasue of your donation...!

13:09.910 --> 13:12.370
Our orphanage turned to ruin!

13:13.620 --> 13:14.960
﻿To ruin...?

13:15.120 --> 13:16.540
﻿That's right!

13:16.540 --> 13:19.330
﻿Before our Director had received your donation...

13:19.670 --> 13:23.510
﻿we may have been poor, but we lived in happiness.

13:25.430 --> 13:27.840
﻿Then, out of cheap sympathy, you came with your money.

13:28.390 --> 13:31.140
﻿Afterwards, all because he accepted your donation,

13:31.390 --> 13:33.310
﻿the Director transformed into a different person.

13:33.600 --> 13:35.730
﻿He left, leaving all of us behind!

13:36.980 --> 13:39.350
﻿Our Pegasus Orphanage then fell to ruin.

13:41.230 --> 13:44.860
﻿Now, we're the only two that are left on this island.

13:50.780 --> 13:53.620
﻿All of this is because of your single whimsical gesture!

13:53.700 --> 13:54.790
﻿I regret to hear that...

13:55.040 --> 13:57.330
﻿But, I didn't do it with those intenti—

13:57.330 --> 13:59.290
﻿Shut up! You're the one who's in the wrong!

13:59.540 --> 14:01.960
﻿Hold on a second! You're making a false accusation here!

14:02.090 --> 14:04.000
﻿Francis isn't the one wrong here!

14:04.630 --> 14:06.260
﻿Do you really think so?

14:08.760 --> 14:10.800
﻿Nobles like him go abound claiming that it's "charity",

14:11.100 --> 14:13.430
﻿but they're just using money to buy their own self-satisfaction!

14:14.930 --> 14:16.890
﻿By doing that, he looks down upon us common folk...

14:17.100 --> 14:20.020
﻿and doesn't even drop one bead of sweat with what he docs!

14:20.020 --> 14:20.810
﻿You're wrong!

14:23.270 --> 14:24.570
﻿W-What?!

14:25.030 --> 14:26.190
﻿H-Hey!

14:29.450 --> 14:30.530
﻿Take a look at this!

14:34.540 --> 14:35.580
This is...

14:35.580 --> 14:38.370
﻿Because of him, our orphanage...

14:38.500 --> 14:40.830
﻿Our home now looks like this!

14:44.170 --> 14:46.090
We have no house to return to...

14:46.550 --> 14:47.960
﻿We can no longer...

14:47.970 --> 14:50.880
﻿live together with everyone in the orphanage like we once did!

15:00.940 --> 15:01.980
﻿That's...

15:02.400 --> 15:04.690
﻿That's why I came to this island.

15:05.190 --> 15:08.070
﻿If there was still anything else I could do...

15:08.400 --> 15:09.860
Anything else you could do?

15:10.070 --> 15:13.030
﻿Well then, can you go and use that flashy money of yours...

15:13.030 --> 15:15.830
﻿and bring back the kind Director we used to have?!

15:15.830 --> 15:16.790
Give him back!

15:18.330 --> 15:21.000
﻿Hurry... and get off of this island!

15:23.630 --> 15:24.670
Understand?

15:27.710 --> 15:28.880
﻿You must be disillusioned now...

15:30.720 --> 15:33.090
﻿Hearing all about noblesse oblige from me...

15:34.390 --> 15:35.760
﻿It's just as those children said...

15:36.010 --> 15:39.520
﻿In the end, ail I was doing was just spewing out idealistic thoughts...

15:40.020 --> 15:41.140
﻿What's the matter with you...?

15:41.140 --> 15:43.560
﻿For you to be saying things like that, you're not being your usual self!

15:43.980 --> 15:45.270
﻿Not being my usual self...

15:45.730 --> 15:48.780
﻿Then, let me hear it. What is my "usual self"?

15:51.900 --> 15:52.900
﻿This is me...

15:53.360 --> 15:56.410
﻿The person you see right now is the real me...

15:57.240 --> 16:00.000
﻿I'm not the great noble person you thought I was.

16:00.620 --> 16:01.710
﻿No way...

16:01.710 --> 16:03.370
﻿Just what do you keep looking at?

16:03.670 --> 16:06.840
﻿The one you fell in love with was not me, but Keith. Am I right?!

16:08.250 --> 16:10.300
﻿Please spare me your pity...

16:11.010 --> 16:12.510
﻿The way I am now...

16:13.130 --> 16:15.090
﻿can you still say you love me?

16:52.420 --> 16:53.340
﻿Francis...

16:53.880 --> 16:56.090
﻿wasn't my starry-eyed knight...

17:13.360 --> 17:15.200
﻿All right! I'm counting on all of you today again!

17:15.200 --> 17:16.070
﻿Let's give it our best!

17:16.280 --> 17:17.110
Yeah!

17:17.370 --> 17:19.490
﻿Sylvie! Could you get my hoops?

17:19.490 --> 17:21.030
﻿Could you also pull out my costume?

17:22.410 --> 17:23.120
﻿Nadja.

17:24.750 --> 17:25.830
﻿Hey, Nadja.

17:25.830 --> 17:27.040
﻿Y-Yes!

17:27.040 --> 17:27.870
﻿Are you all right?

17:27.960 --> 17:30.340
Er, huh? Oh, yes, l'm fine...

17:30.960 --> 17:32.090
﻿Don't lie.

17:33.260 --> 17:37.800
﻿I can't let someone who gives me such an absentminded answer to perform on stage.

17:44.060 --> 17:45.810
Geez! I'm such a big idiot!

17:46.770 --> 17:48.810
﻿Zoning out like that...

17:54.570 --> 17:55.610
﻿Francis...

17:56.820 --> 18:01.120
﻿Why... why couldn't I say, "I still love you," I wonder...?

18:01.780 --> 18:02.620
﻿Why...?

18:04.330 --> 18:07.660
﻿But... for Francis to say something like that...

18:07.920 --> 18:09.920
﻿Just what do you keep looking at?!

18:10.330 --> 18:13.960
﻿The one you fell in love with was not me, but Keith. Am I right?!

18:35.400 --> 18:36.740
﻿The Black Rose...

18:37.740 --> 18:38.650
﻿Nadja.

18:39.320 --> 18:41.240
﻿I want you to remember at least this much.

18:42.530 --> 18:43.740
﻿I am me.

18:44.240 --> 18:45.700
I ﻿am no one else.

18:46.910 --> 18:47.830
﻿Francis...

18:48.750 --> 18:52.290
﻿The way I am now... can you still say you love me?

18:53.710 --> 18:54.670
﻿I...

18:58.420 --> 19:01.680
﻿I wonder what I saw in those two..

19:02.970 --> 19:04.220
﻿Francis' usual self...

19:04.810 --> 19:06.470
﻿The Black Rose's usual self...

19:06.470 --> 19:07.470
﻿My usual self...

19:08.230 --> 19:09.310
﻿Our true selves...

19:10.560 --> 19:12.520
﻿This is me...

19:12.650 --> 19:14.810
﻿The person you see right now

19:14.820 --> 19:17.360
﻿is the real me...

19:17.360 --> 19:19.490
﻿the real me...

19:20.400 --> 19:21.530
﻿I don't understand...

19:27.540 --> 19:29.580
﻿But, this isn't my usual self!

19:30.210 --> 19:32.370
Ah﻿, geez! Why did the things turn out this way?

19:32.580 --> 19:35.460
﻿If I keep being hesitant like this. I'll only get gloomier!

20:53.960 --> 20:57.040
﻿If it was any usual thing... I would've been relieved once I danced...

21:08.300 --> 21:09.600
﻿Francis...

22:14.470 --> 22:17.720
Paris is sunnier than London

22:14.470 --> 22:17.720
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

22:17.840 --> 22:20.930
Carmen likes paella more than pasta

22:17.840 --> 22:20.930
CARUMEN men yori PAERIYA suki

22:21.350 --> 22:27.520
The Queen of Spades is a fickle person

22:21.350 --> 22:27.520
SUPEEDO no jou kimagure yasan

22:28.480 --> 22:29.720
Indeed

22:28.480 --> 22:29.720
Kitto

22:32.480 --> 22:34.900
It's not use worrying about it

22:32.480 --> 22:34.900
Nayan datte MUDA yo

22:35.480 --> 22:38.610
Que sera sera, sera Sera

22:35.480 --> 22:38.610
KE SERA SERA SERA SERA

22:38.870 --> 22:43.580
Tomorrow's going to be whatever it was meant

22:38.870 --> 22:43.580
Ashita nante itsumo naru you ni

22:43.660 --> 22:45.040
To be, to be

22:43.660 --> 22:45.040
Naru naru

22:45.370 --> 22:50.380
The tree fog won

22:45.370 --> 22:50.380
Sekai KAERU tobi KONKUURU

22:50.840 --> 22:54.760
The world frog-jumping contest

22:50.840 --> 22:54.760
Yuushou shita yo AMAGAERU

22:57.970 --> 23:04.140
Under the kitten's paw

22:57.970 --> 23:04.140
Koneko chan no ashi no ura wa

23:04.560 --> 23:10.730
Is the scent of the sun, right?

23:04.560 --> 23:10.730
Otentou sama no nioi dane

23:13.570 --> 23:16.900
Paris is sunnier than London

23:13.570 --> 23:16.900
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

23:16.990 --> 23:19.990
Carmen likes paella more than pasta

